            About <span class="text-black">SmartFloor</span>
        </h1>
    </header>

    <section class="py-16 mb-32">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-24 items-start">
            <div class="relative">
                <div class="rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden h-[600px]">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1200"
                        class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                </div>
                <button
