                            <i class="ph-bold ph-x text-xl transition-all duration-300"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-content overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out"
                            style="max-height: 500px; opacity: 1;">
                            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500 font-medium w-11/12 mt-4">
                                One of our primary goals is to provide the best quality flooring products in the market.
                                We carefully select our suppliers and test every product to ensure it meets our high
                                standards.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Item 2 -->
                    <div class="border-b border-gray-100 py-6 accordion-item">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer group accordion-header">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-xl">Sustainability</h4>
                            <i class="ph-bold ph-plus text-xl transition-all duration-300"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="accordion-content overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0">
                            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500 font-medium w-11/12 mt-4">
                                We prioritize eco-friendly solutions ensuring top production quality. Our manufacturing
                                processes are designed to minimize environmental impact while maximizing durability.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Item 3 -->
                    <div class="border-b border-gray-100 py-6 accordion-item">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer group accordion-header">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-xl">Unmatched variety</h4>
                            <i class="ph-bold ph-plus text-xl transition-all duration-300"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="accordion-content overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0">
                            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500 font-medium w-11/12 mt-4">
                                With an extensive collection of tiles across various categories like porcelain, ceramic,
                                and vitrified, we offer designs that cater to every aesthetic preference, from modern to
                                traditional.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Item 4 -->
                    <div class="border-b border-gray-100 py-6 accordion-item">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer group accordion-header">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-xl">Legacy of excellence</h4>
                            <i class="ph-bold ph-plus text-xl transition-all duration-300"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="accordion-content overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0">
                            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500 font-medium w-11/12 mt-4">
                                Built on a foundation of trust and customer satisfaction, SmartFloor has been serving
                                homes and businesses for years, becoming a name synonymous with reliability and style.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-32">
        <div class="relative rounded-[3.5rem] overflow-hidden h-[600px] shadow-sm">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599619351208-3e6c839d6828?q=80&w=2400&auto=format&fit=crop"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover" />

            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/5"></div>

            <div class="absolute inset-0 p-16 flex flex-col justify-center">
                <div class="max-w-4xl">
                    <h2
                        class="text-5xl xl:text-[4rem] font-extrabold leading-[1.1] [text-shadow:_0_2px_10px_rgb(255_255_255_/_0.6)] text-black mb-8">
                        When We Collect <br />
                        Products, We Strive <br />
                        For The Finest Quality.
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <button
                    class="absolute top-12 right-12 bg-[#1A1A1A] hover:bg-black text-white pl-8 pr-3 py-3 rounded-full flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-bold shadow-xl transition transform hover:-translate-y-1">
                    Consult Now
                    <div class="bg-white text-black w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                        <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-right text-sm"></i>
                    </div>
                </button>

                <button
                    class="absolute bottom-16 left-16 bg-[#1A1A1A] hover:bg-black text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-full text-base font-bold shadow-xl transition transform hover:-translate-y-1">
                    See Products
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    </div>
    <%- include('../partials/footer.ejs') %>
        <script>
            document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
                const headers = document.querySelectorAll('.accordion-header');

                headers.forEach(header => {
                    header.addEventListener('click', () => {
                        const content = header.nextElementSibling;
                        const icon = header.querySelector('i');

                        // Check open state by checking max-height
                        const isOpen = content.style.maxHeight && content.style.maxHeight !== '0px';

                        if (isOpen) {
                            content.style.maxHeight = '0px';
                            content.style.opacity = '0';
                            icon.classList.replace('ph-x', 'ph-plus');
                        } else {
                            content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + "px";
                            content.style.opacity = '1';
                            icon.classList.replace('ph-plus', 'ph-x');
                        }
                    });
                });
            });

            // Video Modal Script
            const videoModal = document.getElementById('videoModal');
            const videoPlayer = document.getElementById('promoVideo');
            const playButton = document.querySelector('.ph-play').parentElement;
            const closeVideoButton = document.getElementById('closeVideo');

            if (playButton) {
                playButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    videoModal.classList.remove('hidden');
                    videoPlayer.play();
                });
            }

            if (closeVideoButton) {
                closeVideoButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    videoModal.classList.add('hidden');
                    videoPlayer.pause();
                    videoPlayer.currentTime = 0;
                });
            }

            // Close modal when clicking outside the video
            if (videoModal) {
                videoModal.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
                    if (e.target === videoModal) {
                        videoModal.classList.add('hidden');
                        videoPlayer.pause();
                        videoPlayer.currentTime = 0;
                    }
                });
            }
        </script>

        <!-- Video Modal -->
        <div id="videoModal"
            class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
            <div class="relative w-full max-w-5xl bg-black rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
                <button id="closeVideo"
                    class="absolute top-4 right-4 z-10 w-10 h-10 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white transition-colors">
                    <i class="ph-bold ph-x text-xl"></i>
                </button>
                <video id="promoVideo" class="w-full h-auto max-h-[80vh]" controls>
                    <source src="/videos/Flooring eCommerce Powerhouse.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                    Your browser does not support the video tag.
                </video>
            </div>
        </div>
        </body>

        </html>